---
// The last frame of a real `pg-probe capture` run on db-prod-01, drawn as
// text so it stays sharp at any size. Values come from that run.
---
<div class="tc">
<div class="tc-cmd"><span class="tc-ps">postgres@db-prod-01:~$</span> pg-probe capture -h 127.0.0.1 -U postgres --duration 3m --interval 5s</div>
<div class="tc-row"><span class="tc-badge">pg-probe</span><span class="tc-ver">0.4.0</span> <b>Capture</b> <span class="tc-m">· 3m every 5s</span></div>
<div class="tc-sec">Progress</div>
<div class="tc-kv"><span>Samples</span><b>37</b></div>
<div class="tc-kv"><span>Elapsed</span><span><b>3m00s</b> <span class="tc-m">of 3m00s</span> <i class="tc-bar"></i></span></div>
<div class="tc-kv"><span>Status</span><b>done</b></div>
<div class="tc-kv tc-art"><span>Artifact</span><span><mark>./db-prod-01-2026-10-24-19h37m27s.sqlite.gz</mark> <span class="tc-m">534.0 KiB</span></span></div>
<div class="tc-sec">Collectors</div>
<div class="tc-grid tc-head"><span></span><span>ok</span><span>unsup</span><span>errors</span><span></span></div>
<div class="tc-grid"><span>Snapshot</span><b>50</b><span>1</span><span>0</span><span></span></div>
<div class="tc-grid"><span>Linux</span><b>13</b><span>0</span><span>0</span><span class="tc-m">each sample</span></div>
<div class="tc-grid"><span>PostgreSQL</span><b>13</b><span>0</span><span>0</span><span class="tc-m">each sample</span></div>
<div class="tc-kv"><span></span><span class="tc-m">ok and unsup: last sample · errors: all samples</span></div>
<div class="tc-sec">Cost</div>
<div class="tc-kv"><span>Sample time</span><span><b>86.0ms</b> <span class="tc-m">last · p95</span> <b>552.4ms</b> <span class="tc-m">· p99</span> <b>1.3s</b> <span class="tc-m">· 36 samples</span></span></div>
<div class="tc-kv"><span>CPU</span><span><b>0.54%</b> <span class="tc-m">sampling ·</span> <b>0.56%</b> <span class="tc-m">overall</span></span></div>
<div class="tc-kv"><span>Memory</span><span><b>7.5 MiB</b> <span class="tc-m">peak resident</span></span></div>
<div class="tc-kv"><span>Disk writes</span><b>128.2 MiB</b></div>
<div class="tc-done"><b>DONE!</b> Capture finished</div>
<div class="tc-cmd"><span class="tc-ps">postgres@db-prod-01:~$</span> <i class="tc-cur"></i></div>
</div>

<style>
  .tc { font: 400 12.5px/1.65 var(--mono); color: #e4e4e7; padding: 1rem 1.25rem; background: #09090b; height: 100%; overflow: hidden; }
  .tc b { font-weight: 700; color: #fafafa; }
  .tc-m { color: #8b8b93; }
  .tc-ps { color: #e4e4e7; }
  .tc-row, .tc-kv, .tc-grid, .tc-sec, .tc-done { padding-left: 1.25rem; }
  .tc-badge { background: #e5b53b; color: #09090b; font-weight: 700; padding: 0 0.5rem; }
  .tc-ver { background: #3a3834; color: #eeece9; padding: 0 0.5rem; }
  .tc-sec { color: #a1a1aa; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; margin-top: 0.9em; }
  .tc-sec::after { content: ''; flex: 1; height: 1px; background: #3f3f46; }
  .tc-kv { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 9.5rem 1fr; }
  .tc-kv > span:first-child, .tc-grid > span:first-child { color: #a1a1aa; }
  .tc-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 9.5rem 3rem 3.5rem 3.5rem 1fr; }
  .tc-grid > :nth-child(n+2):nth-child(-n+4) { text-align: right; padding-right: 0.5rem; }
  .tc-grid.tc-head span { color: #a1a1aa; }
  .tc-bar { display: inline-block; width: 12rem; height: 2px; background: #e5b53b; vertical-align: middle; margin-left: 0.6rem; }
  mark { background: transparent; color: inherit; }
  .tc-done { margin: 1em 0 0 1.25rem; padding-left: 0.6rem; background: #5bd295; color: #09090b; }
  .tc-done b { color: #09090b; margin-right: 0.6rem; }
  .tc-cur { display: inline-block; width: 0.6em; height: 1.1em; background: #e5b53b; vertical-align: text-bottom; animation: blink 1s steps(1) infinite; }
  @keyframes blink { 50% { opacity: 0; } }
</style>
